ating":4.70242,"languageCodesISO2A":["AR","BG","HR","CS","DA","NL","EN","FI","FR","DE","EL","HE","HI","HU","ID","IT","JA","KO","LV","LT","NB","PL","PT","RO","RU","SR","ZH","SK","SL","ES","SV","TH","ZH","TR","UK","VI"],"fileSizeBytes":"155104256","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":9171,"trackContentRating":"4+","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.70242,"releaseNotes":"• Faster, smoother photo sharing: Photos and videos sent to offline frames now delivers as soon as the frame when it comes online, regardless of whether the app is running or not.\n\n• Send Event (Frameo Premium): You can now send events with details directly to your frame! Keep your family up to date on upcoming celebrations, appointments, and special milestones right on screen.","genres":["Photo & Video","Social Networking"],"price":0.0,"bundleId":"net.frameo.app","genreIds":["6008","6005"],"primaryGenreName":"Photo & Video","primaryGenreId":6008,"releaseDate":"2016-12-08T21:22:44Z","trackId":1179744119,"trackName":"Frameo","sellerName":"Frameo A/S","isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-08-24T07:19:18Z","version":"1.40","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"Share moments instantly. Connect families forever.\n\nSend photos and videos from your phone to any Frameo frame – your own, or your family's, wherever they are. Downloaded over 30 million times by families around the world.\n\nONE FRAME FOR YOUR MEMORIES AND YOUR PLANS\nFrameo turns a WiFi photo frame into a family hub. A toddler's first steps, next week's soccer game – your moments and your schedule, on the frame in your living room and in the homes of the people you love.\n\nFREE, AND ALWAYS WILL BE:\n\n- Send up to 10 photos or 15-second videos at a time, as often as you like. They appear in seconds.\n\n- Sync one calendar so birthdays, events, and plans show up on the frame.\n\n- Add captions, or use Greetings – fun graphics for holidays and celebrations.\n\n- Group photos into Albums for weddings, holidays, and vacations.\n\n- Connect to any frame with a code, invite as many people as you like, and get a notification when someone likes your photo.\n\nEvery feature listed above is free, and stays free. There are no fees to send or receive.\n\nWHAT YOU CAN COUNT ON:\n\nPrivate by design, end-to-end encryption and full compliance with GDPR, CCPA, and PSTI. Your photos stay yours.\n\nRegular updates for your app and frame, always included.\n\n\nWANT MORE? TWO OPTIONAL UPGRADES:\nEverything above stays free. Frameo+ and Premium simply add more on top.\n\nFRAMEO+ – MORE WAYS TO SHARE:\n\nSend up to 100 photos at a time\n\nSend videos up to 2 minutes\n\nHide or delete frame photos from your phone\n\nCloud Backup with client-side encryption\n\nCast to your TV with Google Cast\n$1.99/month or $16.99/year*\n\nPREMIUM – THE COMPLETE EXPERIENCE:\nEverything in Frameo+ including the full calendar:\n\nUnlimited calendar syncs across up to 5 frames\n\nSend Events: create an event with a photo, place, and description, and send it to your own frame or a loved one's\n\nCountdown to birthdays, trips, and milestones\n\nTimed Calendar View: show the calendar during the hours that suit your family, then switch back to photos\n\nCustom event colors\n$7.99/month or $69.99/year*\n\nBoth paid plans include a 14-day free trial. Read more: http://frameo.com/subscriptions \n\nSETTING UP OR JUST SENDING?\nThe app is all you need either way - set up your own new frame, or connect to a loved one's and start sending. Works with official Frameo WiFi photo frames only. Find a retailer: http://frameo.com/#Shop \n\nStay updated by following Frameo on social media:\nfacebook.com/frameoapp\ninstagram.com/frameo_app\nyoutube.com/@frameoapp\n\n*Price may vary depending on country.","minimumOsVersion":"16.4","artistId":1179744118,"artistName":"Frameo A/S","userRatingCount":9171}